cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Swarm Colosseum, its results or its tactic library, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Swarm Colosseum: an open arena for AI swarm-attack and air-defence policies in an abstract simulator"
abstract: >-
  An abstract strategy game and research benchmark. Attacker and defender policies are
  short Python programs that play deterministic, sandboxed matches in made-up units on a
  blank 2D plane; defenders are scored on cost exchange as well as survival. A nightly
  league of language-model-written bots, two Elo ladders, replays, and a tactic library of
  the ideas that earned a place. It does not model any real system.
license:
